  "description": "The framework registry for endpoint, service and URL detection (P7). The detector matches RESOLVED annotation FQNs, DSL callee FQNs and supertype names against these patterns (suffix-segment match, see PatternMatcher) and never hard-codes a framework. A framework the pack does not name is invisible by construction, and every pattern here is validated by a build-time test. annotation FQNs must resolve through the workspace declarations or a real classpath: an unresolved annotation keeps its PSI short name and only matches when the pack pattern is itself a short name, which is never \u2014 type identity, not name matching, is what keeps a homonym annotation from becoming an endpoint.",
